Look around.

00:32:07.493 --> 00:32:08.380
Everybody look around.

00:32:09.350 --> 00:32:13.350
This was the most common
way we talked six years ago.

00:32:13.350 --> 00:32:14.930
Please sit.

00:32:14.930 --> 00:32:17.850
We're now literally,
if somebody calls you,

00:32:17.850 --> 00:32:19.400
you look at it and you're like,

00:32:20.410 --> 00:32:22.633
hello, Mom, why are you calling me?

00:32:23.488 --> 00:32:27.490
This is because the number one thing

00:32:27.490 --> 00:32:30.173
that I trade on is time.

00:32:31.610 --> 00:32:34.803
Friction is the biggest vulnerability.

00:32:35.760 --> 00:32:37.210
For a lot of people in
the internet business

00:32:37.210 --> 00:32:39.450
this is why UX, UI, design,

00:32:39.450 --> 00:32:41.760
all this stuff matters so much.

00:32:41.760 --> 00:32:45.150
Any friction you cause is devastating.

00:32:45.150 --> 00:32:48.250
The second wi-fi is a
hundredth of a second slower

00:32:48.250 --> 00:32:50.140
than you're used to.

00:32:50.140 --> 00:32:51.043
You are devastated.

00:32:52.630 --> 00:32:57.571
Voice is going to be the next frontier,

00:32:57.571 --> 00:32:59.862
and the same way that everybody here

00:32:59.862 --> 00:33:00.950
used to call but now texts,

00:33:00.950 --> 00:33:03.060
because time is so valuable,

00:33:03.060 --> 00:33:06.510
and it is actually common courtesy

00:33:06.510 --> 00:33:08.360
to why you're not calling.

00:33:08.360 --> 00:33:11.585
Calling somebody now without
telling them you're calling

00:33:11.585 --> 00:33:13.913
is an invasion on their time.

00:33:16.140 --> 00:33:19.283
Soon voice will replace that.

00:33:20.260 --> 00:33:23.320
If you really want to be
on the cusp of what's next,

00:33:23.320 --> 00:33:25.710
I genuinely believe that Alexa,

00:33:25.710 --> 00:33:28.900
and Google Home and voice activated UI,

00:33:28.900 --> 00:33:31.420
is going to be unbelievably powerful.

00:33:31.420 --> 00:33:35.030
It is a very very vibrant place.

00:33:35.030 --> 00:33:36.380
It is.

00:33:36.380 --> 00:33:39.600
That's one place to talk
and pay attention to,

00:33:39.600 --> 00:33:43.430
but this all rounds up to
a very simple conversation

00:33:43.430 --> 00:33:46.520
which is if you look
at the history of time

00:33:46.520 --> 00:33:49.580
for entrepreneurship, for the human race,

00:33:49.580 --> 00:33:53.770
there's all leads to one
road which is timing.

00:33:53.770 --> 00:33:56.040
Timing.

00:33:56.040 --> 00:33:58.380
It's unbelievable how much timing

00:33:58.380 --> 00:34:00.980
plays a factor in all of this.

00:34:00.980 --> 00:34:04.010
So many people back
there and in your heads

00:34:04.010 --> 00:34:05.823
are playing too much in the future.

00:34:06.660 --> 00:34:08.100
Three years ago all my friends

00:34:08.100 --> 00:34:12.420
spend all their money
on VR, virtual reality.

00:34:12.420 --> 00:34:15.200
Meanwhile I didn't know one person

00:34:15.200 --> 00:34:17.510
who spent an hour on virtual reality

00:34:17.510 --> 00:34:19.053
a month consistently.

00:34:20.162 --> 00:34:23.720
So many people talk
about the future timing.

00:34:23.720 --> 00:34:26.516
Of course AR, machine learning, VR,

00:34:26.516 --> 00:34:28.255
all this stuff is coming,

00:34:28.255 --> 00:34:30.510
but until you see it with real people

00:34:30.510 --> 00:34:32.160
it's an enormous leap,

00:34:32.160 --> 00:34:34.133
and you're gonna get your timing wrong.

00:34:35.570 --> 00:34:36.970
On the same token,

00:34:36.970 --> 00:34:38.840
the things I'm passionate about.

00:34:38.840 --> 00:34:41.630
When I talk about Facebook
or Instagram or Snapchat

00:34:41.630 --> 00:34:43.860
it is only because it's current.

00:34:43.860 --> 00:34:46.830
In four years I will
sit on stages like this

00:34:46.830 --> 00:34:48.530
and I will laugh at everybody here

00:34:48.530 --> 00:34:50.570
buying Instagram story ads,

00:34:50.570 --> 00:34:52.380
because the market will catch up

00:34:52.380 --> 00:34:55.000
and thus it will become over priced.

00:34:55.000 --> 00:34:57.150
Both demand for the ads will rise.

00:34:57.150 --> 00:34:58.470
So the price will go up,

00:34:58.470 --> 00:35:00.170
and you'll stop paying attention,

00:35:00.170 --> 00:35:02.093
because more ads will show up.

00:35:02.980 --> 00:35:06.770
This timing, this trading, this pulse,

00:35:06.770 --> 00:35:09.430
is the single most important thing,

00:35:09.430 --> 00:35:11.640
once you understand who you are.

00:35:11.640 --> 00:35:14.378
Please start paying much bigger attention

00:35:14.378 --> 00:35:18.270
to consumer's behaviors, to timing.

00:35:18.270 --> 00:35:20.550
I was interviewed right
before I came up here

00:35:20.550 --> 00:35:22.690
and the woman said,

00:35:22.690 --> 00:35:24.470
who do you pay attention to?

00:35:24.470 --> 00:35:26.420
