00:35:27.970 --> 00:35:29.320
I don't read books.

00:35:29.320 --> 00:35:31.160
I don't listen to podcasts.

00:35:31.160 --> 00:35:33.850
All I do is read you.

00:35:33.850 --> 00:35:36.653
Tonight, when I'm at the
airport on my way home,

00:35:36.653 --> 00:35:39.502
I'm going to look at the
hashtag of this event

00:35:39.502 --> 00:35:41.670
and I'm gonna see what you had to say

00:35:41.670 --> 00:35:43.090
about the event.

00:35:43.090 --> 00:35:45.280
I'm gonna see what you
had to say about me.

00:35:45.280 --> 00:35:46.770
About the opening keynote.

00:35:46.770 --> 00:35:48.496
After.

00:35:48.496 --> 00:35:49.920
I consume you.

00:35:49.920 --> 00:35:53.870
If you want to win in a consumer product.

00:35:53.870 --> 00:35:55.230
Not B to B.

00:35:55.230 --> 00:35:58.520
If you want to win in a consumer product,

00:35:58.520 --> 00:36:01.940
I highly recommend you
start training yourself

00:36:01.940 --> 00:36:04.120
to read the consumer.

00:36:04.120 --> 00:36:07.280
Not a thought leader's point
of view on the consumer.

00:36:07.280 --> 00:36:09.150
I would far prefer,

00:36:09.150 --> 00:36:12.560
that you read every
comment about your content

00:36:12.560 --> 00:36:14.570
and your space's content,

00:36:14.570 --> 00:36:16.340
versus watching my content.

00:36:16.340 --> 00:36:18.170
Every day of the week.

00:36:18.170 --> 00:36:20.940
The reason I've had
such a successful career

00:36:20.940 --> 00:36:22.543
is because I don't guess.

00:36:23.695 --> 00:36:25.800
I do the work.

00:36:25.800 --> 00:36:27.230
Then I execute.

00:36:27.230 --> 00:36:29.920
Then I talk about it quickly.

00:36:29.920 --> 00:36:31.350
That is my career.

00:36:31.350 --> 00:36:33.560
The fact that we now live in a world

00:36:33.560 --> 00:36:36.575
where consumer's point of view, opinions,

00:36:36.575 --> 00:36:41.450
are being posted immediately
in real time is remarkable.

00:36:41.450 --> 00:36:43.290
Do you know how many people here

00:36:43.290 --> 00:36:45.330
want to build more
followers and influence,

00:36:45.330 --> 00:36:49.700
yet don't reply to the
comments on their posts?

00:36:49.700 --> 00:36:52.040
The sheer audacity,

00:36:52.040 --> 00:36:54.470
that you want to get
bigger with the world,

00:36:54.470 --> 00:36:56.720
yet, you don't have the time,

00:36:56.720 --> 00:36:59.570
to reply or thank the 13 people

00:36:59.570 --> 00:37:03.473
that give a crap about
you now, is laughable.

00:37:04.330 --> 00:37:06.450
The quickest way I know somebody's

00:37:06.450 --> 00:37:08.600
not on their way to being an influencer,

00:37:08.600 --> 00:37:11.523
is based on their behavior
with their community publicly.

00:37:12.399 --> 00:37:16.704
Please invest back into the
people that invest in you.

00:37:16.704 --> 00:37:19.704
(audience applause)

00:37:26.510 --> 00:37:27.810
I don't know if you heard,

00:37:29.447 --> 00:37:31.590
but the reality of being a human being,

00:37:31.590 --> 00:37:33.350
according to modern science,

00:37:33.350 --> 00:37:35.153
is 400 trillion to one.

00:37:36.260 --> 00:37:38.410
If you follow me for
the last couple years,

00:37:39.277 --> 00:37:40.809
you know I'm obsessed with this,

00:37:40.809 --> 00:37:41.642
because I can't wrap my head around it.

00:37:42.880 --> 00:37:44.930
As somebody who likes math
as much as they like art,

00:37:44.930 --> 00:37:48.764
the sheer thought that
it is 400 trillion to one

00:37:48.764 --> 00:37:50.403
to become a human being,

00:37:52.111 --> 00:37:54.674
is almost difficult for me to swallow

00:37:54.674 --> 00:37:57.380
and leads me to my final
point which is mindset.

00:37:57.380 --> 00:37:59.622
If you are sitting here,

00:37:59.622 --> 00:38:02.920
and you are not driven 100% on gratitude,

00:38:02.920 --> 00:38:05.420
you are misunderstanding
how impossible it is

00:38:05.420 --> 00:38:07.053
to even be a human being.

00:38:07.992 --> 00:38:11.230
The fact that you could have been

00:38:11.230 --> 00:38:15.721
a rhinoceros or a tree or a ladybug,

00:38:15.721 --> 00:38:20.721
it is so remarkable to me how
people have not quantified

00:38:21.560 --> 00:38:23.480
the most basic thing.

00:38:23.480 --> 00:38:27.200
How I sit here, I stand
right here in front of you

00:38:27.200 --> 00:38:29.850
driven 100% on gratitude.

00:38:29.850 --> 00:38:34.580
I am so thankful to even get
the chance to do anything.

00:38:34.580 --> 00:38:36.063
Let alone what I'm doing.

00:38:37.231 --> 00:38:39.900
I promise you, when you
wake up every morning,

00:38:39.900 --> 00:38:42.230
you don't need a meditation pod.

00:38:42.230 --> 00:38:43.620
You don't need a book.

00:38:43.620 --> 00:38:44.760
You don't need a podcast.

00:38:44.760 --> 00:38:45.863
You don't need me.

00:38:47.148 --> 00:38:48.760
If you wake up and
actually say to yourself,

00:38:48.760 --> 00:38:50.980
the likelihood of me having a life

00:38:52.030 --> 00:38:55.916
is more rare than getting
struck by lightning 10 times,

00:38:55.916 --> 00:38:59.680
you will put life in
perspective very quickly.

00:38:59.680 --> 00:39:04.680
Dwelling or complaining or
crying about what you don't have

00:39:05.351 --> 00:39:10.020
versus understanding and
leaning into what you do have,

00:39:10.020 --> 00:39:12.430
is exactly the same way that I understand

00:39:12.430 --> 00:39:14.210
that I wish all of you knew,

00:39:14.210 --> 00:39:16.700
how much better it would
be to build a business here

00:39:16.700 --> 00:39:18.833
than to move to Silicon Valley.

00:39:20.171 --> 00:39:23.171
(audience applause)

00:39:26.170 --> 00:39:27.520
There's no money.

00:39:27.520 --> 00:39:28.920
There's no accolades.

00:39:28.920 --> 00:39:30.110
There's no awards.

00:39:30.110 --> 00:39:32.186
There's no amount of followers

00:39:32.186 --> 00:39:36.330
that can subsidize actual happiness.

00:39:36.330 --> 00:39:39.550
Actual happiness starts very internal.

00:39:39.550 --> 00:39:42.100
It starts with how you see the world,

00:39:42.100 --> 00:39:45.810
and then leads into who
are you listening to,

00:39:45.810 --> 00:39:48.190
and then it goes into your actions.

00:39:48.190 --> 00:39:51.620
The fact that 85% of this audience

00:39:51.620 --> 00:39:53.920
raised their hands and they're under 30,

00:39:53.920 --> 00:39:56.300
which makes me know
that they're gonna live

00:39:56.300 --> 00:39:59.919
three more full lives
based on modern medicine,

00:39:59.919 --> 00:40:03.680
makes me desperately try
to push everybody here

00:40:04.651 --> 00:40:06.440
for perspective and patience

00:40:06.440 --> 00:40:09.710
and right now everybody's
going way too fast.

00:40:09.710 --> 00:40:12.000
Wants everything way too fast

00:40:12.000 --> 00:40:14.150
and if I could get you to slow down

00:40:14.150 --> 00:40:15.900
and pay attention,

00:40:15.900 --> 00:40:17.840
then I would scratch the itch,

00:40:17.840 --> 00:40:19.550
and I stand here,

00:40:19.550 --> 00:40:21.110
not only driven by gratitude,

00:40:21.110 --> 00:40:23.360
but I stand here today, my friends,

00:40:23.360 --> 00:40:24.860
driven by guilt.

00:40:24.860 --> 00:40:27.070
I have enormous, and I mean this,

00:40:27.070 --> 00:40:28.650
an enormous level of guilt,

00:40:28.650 --> 00:40:32.350
of how lucky I was to
be born with nothing,

00:40:32.350 --> 00:40:33.960
to grow up with nothing.

00:40:33.960 --> 00:40:36.770
To have to earn everything for myself

00:40:36.770 --> 00:40:38.990
and most of all to have parents

00:40:38.990 --> 00:40:41.120
that put me in a position to listen

00:40:41.120 --> 00:40:43.290
to myself and nobody else.

00:40:43.290 --> 00:40:44.800
I wish that on all of you.

00:40:44.800 --> 00:40:46.740
I wish you nothing but
health and happiness

00:40:46.740 --> 00:40:49.960
and please, please, rewind this talk,

00:40:49.960 --> 00:40:52.756
because if you follow even a
percentage of the blueprint,

00:40:52.756 --> 00:40:55.040
I think something good will happen.

00:40:55.040 --> 00:40:56.098
Thank you very much.

00:40:56.098 --> 00:40:59.098
(audience applause)

00:41:01.974 --> 00:41:03.177
Thank you!

00:41:05.730 --> 00:41:07.083
Thank you so much.

00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:13.140
I'm just gonna sign this book for him.

00:41:13.140 --> 00:41:14.260
What's that, selfie?

